WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.990
Is 3 × 4 the same as 4 × 3?

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:04.990
Turn the dot grid on its side.

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.750
3 rows of 4 become 4 rows of 3.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.760
Same dots, so same answer: 12.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.016
Turning never changes the count.
